# Downloaded source files. The ICD-10-CM pair is kept because the build
# reads it; everything else is 130MB of ontologies, some of it under
# licences that forbid redistribution. research/scripts/fetch_*.py
# re-downloads any of it.
research/raw/*
!research/raw/icd10cm_codes_2027.txt
!research/raw/icd10cm_order_2027.txt

